# verb_classes.tbl — verb | classes (comma-separated). A class is a column of the verb table the parser reads by name.
#   to_comp      takes to-V (want to go)
#   not_to       takes not to V (promised not to tell)
#   ing_comp     takes V-ing (enjoy swimming)
#   that_comp    takes a that-clause, with or without that (think S)
#   that_only    the clause needs an explicit that (tell that S), a bare NP after it is an object
#   wh_comp      takes an indirect question (know where S)
#   if_comp      takes if/whether S
#   control      V NP to V (told me to go)
#   causative    V NP V-base (made me write -> 書かせた)
#   perception   V NP V-ing (hear someone talking -> 話すのが聞こえる)
#   copular      V + adjective (get angry)
#   change       V + ADJ and ADJ (getting longer and longer -> ますます)
#   dative       to-NP is the indirect object (give NP to NP)
#   ditrans      V NP NP: the first noun phrase is the indirect object に, the second the object を (show me her room)
#   motion       purpose infinitive takes に, not ために (went to see)
#   posture      V + V-ing is manner, ながら (stood looking)
#   comitative   with-NP is と even for a thing (play with a ball)
#   ni_location  location takes に (live in Tokyo); other verbs で
#   ni_where     where -> どこに (where do you live)
#   stative      plain form reads as ている (have -> 持っている)
#   ga           the object takes が (like -> が好き)
advise | control
afford | to_comp
agree | to_comp,comitative
allow | control
arrive | ni_location
ask | not_to,wh_comp,if_comp,control
be | comitative,ni_location,ni_where
become | copular,change
begin | to_comp,ing_comp
believe | that_comp
bring | dative,ditrans
buy | ditrans
care | wh_comp,if_comp
choose | to_comp,not_to
come | motion,posture,comitative,ni_location,ni_where
continue | to_comp
dare | to_comp
dare say | that_comp
decide | to_comp,not_to,wh_comp
eat | comitative
enjoy | to_comp,ing_comp
expect | to_comp,that_comp,control
explain | wh_comp,dative
fail | to_comp
feel | that_comp,that_only,perception,copular
find | perception
find out | wh_comp
finish | to_comp,ing_comp
fly | motion,ni_location
force | control
forget | to_comp,that_comp,that_only,wh_comp
get | control,copular,change,ni_location
give | dative,ditrans
go | motion,posture,comitative,ni_location,ni_where
grow | copular,change
guess | that_comp,wh_comp
happen | to_comp
hate | to_comp,ing_comp,ga
have | causative,stative
hear | that_comp,that_only,perception
help | to_comp,control
hold | stative
hope | to_comp,not_to,that_comp
hurry | motion
imagine | wh_comp
intend | to_comp
keep | to_comp,ing_comp
know | that_comp,that_only,wh_comp,if_comp,stative
learn | to_comp,wh_comp
leave | motion
lend | dative,ditrans
let | causative
lie | posture
like | to_comp,ing_comp,control,ga
live | comitative,ni_location,ni_where,stative
look | copular
love | to_comp,ing_comp,stative
make | causative
manage | to_comp,not_to
mean | to_comp
mind | ing_comp
move | ni_location
need | to_comp,ga
notice | perception
offer | to_comp
order | control
ought | to_comp
pay | dative,ditrans
plan | to_comp
play | comitative
practice | ing_comp
prefer | to_comp,not_to
pretend | to_comp,not_to
promise | to_comp,not_to
put | ni_location
put down | ni_location
refuse | to_comp
remember | to_comp,that_comp,that_only,wh_comp
return | motion,ni_location
run | motion,posture
say | that_comp,wh_comp,dative
see | wh_comp,if_comp,perception
seem | to_comp,copular
send | dative,ditrans
show | wh_comp,dative,ditrans
sit | posture,ni_location
smell | perception
speak | comitative
spend | posture
stand | posture,ni_location
start | to_comp,ing_comp
stay | motion,comitative,ni_location,ni_where
stop | to_comp,ing_comp,motion
suppose | that_comp
talk | comitative
teach | control,dative,ditrans
tell | not_to,that_comp,that_only,wh_comp,control,dative
tend | to_comp
think | that_comp,wh_comp
try | to_comp,not_to
turn | copular
understand | wh_comp,ga
wait | posture
walk | motion,posture
want | not_to,control,ga
watch | perception
wear | stative
wish | to_comp,that_comp
wonder | wh_comp,if_comp
work | comitative,stative
write | dative,ni_location
